codex
I found the preflight failure’s concrete cause: this sandbox reports a namespace-local PID from `getpid()`, while `/proc` exposes host PIDs; Lean 4.22 resolves its executable via `/proc/<getpid>/exe`, so it cannot locate itself here. I’m applying a narrowly scoped audit-only preload shim that maps `getpid()` to `/proc/self/status`’s visible PID, then rerunning the unmodified trusted `check_generation`.
